sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgb(241,245,249)
    actor U as Alice
  end
  box rgb(219,234,254)
    participant A as Chain A
  end
  box rgb(237,233,254)
    participant E as Ethereum
  end
  box rgb(220,252,231)
    participant B as Chain B
  end
  box rgb(254,243,199)
    participant X as Executor
  end
  U->>A: send leg 1<br/>(funds leave Alice)
  rect rgb(254,226,226)
    Note over A,B: legs must settle<br/>by the deadline (Ethereum time)
    A->>E: settle batch<br/>with leg 1
    B->>E: settle batches,<br/>none with leg 2
  end
  rect rgb(254,202,202)
    Note over U,X: Deadline passes: leg 2 is missing, the flow can never be finalized
  end
  E->>A: import an interop root<br/>newer than the deadline
  X->>B: get timeout proof<br/>for leg 2
  X->>A: authorize refund<br/>with that proof
  X->>A: claim refund<br/>for leg 1
  A->>U: return Alice's<br/>funds
